{"baseTypeIndex":4,"blankCount":1,"difficulty":9,"exerciseID":"0oldwJlhBHFyxipDopd","exerciseType":"fillin","gradeIndex":8,"gradeLevel":"","gradeName":"八年级","optCount":4,"queAns":"①③④","queCtlgs":[{"catalogId":"5ed7677da47b5ff800318152","queId":"0oldwJlhBHFyxipDopd","schCode":"0000","textbookId":"5ed740d9004931cec743eee6"}],"question":"如图，在△ABC中，∠A＝60°，角平分线BD，CE交于点O，OF⊥AB于点F．下列结论：①∠EOB＝60°；②BF+CD＝BC；③AE+AD＝2AF；④S<sub>四边形BEDC</sub>＝2S<sub>△BOC</sub>+S<sub>△EDO</sub>．其中正确结论是 　                　．<img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/quesbank/v3Images/2022/18281fdb3a603o6.png\">","solution":"如图1，∵∠A＝60°，∴∠ABC+∠ACB＝120°，∵BD、CE分别平分∠ABC、∠ACB，且BD、CE相交于点O，∴∠OBC＝∠OBA＝<img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/quesbank/v3Images/2022/18281fe66db03og.png\">∠ABC，∠OCB＝∠OCA＝<img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/quesbank/v3Images/2022/18281fe66e103o7.png\">∠ACB，∴∠OBC+∠OCB＝<img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/quesbank/v3Images/2022/18281fe66e503m7.png\">（∠ABC+∠ACB）＝60°，∴∠EOB＝∠OBC+∠OCB＝60°，故①正确；如图2，在BC上截取BM＝BE，连接OM，在△BOE和△BOM中，<img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/quesbank/v3Images/2022/18281fe66ec03oh.png\">，∴△BOE≌△BOM（SAS），∴OE＝OM，∠EOB＝∠BOM＝60°，∵∠COD＝∠EOB＝60°，∴∠COM＝180°﹣∠BOM﹣∠COD＝60°，∴∠COD＝∠COM，在△COD和△COM中，<img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/quesbank/v3Images/2022/18281fe66f103o8.png\">，∴△COD≌△COM{ASA），∴CD＝CM，∴BE+CD＝BC，故②错误；如图3，作OH⊥AC于点H，OG⊥BC于点G，连接OA，∵OF⊥AB于点F，∴∠AFO＝∠AHO＝90°，∠OFE＝∠OHD＝90°，∵OF＝OG，OH＝OG，∴OF＝OH，在Rt△AOF和Rt△AOH中，<img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/quesbank/v3Images/2022/18281fe66fc03m8.png\">，∴Rt△AOF≌Rt△AOH（HL），∴AF＝AH，∵∠EAC＝∠COD＝60°，∴∠EAC+∠ACE＝∠COD+∠ACE，∵∠OEF＝∠EAC+∠ACE，∠ODH＝∠COD+∠ACE，∴∠OEF＝∠ODH，在△OEF和△ODH中，<img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/quesbank/v3Images/2022/18281fe670903oi.png\">，∴△OEF≌△ODH（AAS），∴EF＝DH，∴AE+AD＝AE+AH+DH＝AE+AH+EF＝AF+AH＝2AF，故③正确；如图2，∵△BOE≌△BOM，△COD≌△COM，∴S<sub>△BOE</sub>＝S<sub>△BOM</sub>，S<sub>△COD</sub>＝S<sub>△COM</sub>，∴S<sub>△BOE</sub>+S<sub>△COD</sub>＝S<sub>△BOM</sub>+S<sub>△COM</sub>，＝S<sub>△BOC</sub>，∴S<sub>四边形BEDC</sub>＝S<sub>△BOC</sub>+S<sub>△BOE</sub>+S<sub>△COD</sub>+S<sub>△EDO</sub>＝2S<sub>△BOC</sub>+S<sub>△EDO</sub>，故④正确，故答案为：①③④．<img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/quesbank/v3Images/2022/18281fe674a03oj.png\"><img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/quesbank/v3Images/2022/18281fe675003m9.png\"><img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/quesbank/v3Images/2022/18281fe671e03o9.png\">","subQueNum":0,"subQues":[],"subjectCategory":"math","tags":[{"coreFlag":0,"examPointFlag":0,"knowId":"5ec3489a518ec3c65e1e8b43","knowName":"三角形的角平分线","knowTypeId":"5d424a75a7cbaf0014c9df22","knowTypeName":"知识点","lastExamPointFlag":0,"priority":1,"queId":"0oldwJlhBHFyxipDopd","sortIndex":633},{"coreFlag":0,"examPointFlag":0,"knowId":"5ec348c6518ec3c65e1e8b47","knowName":"三角形的内角和定理","knowTypeId":"5d424a75a7cbaf0014c9df22","knowTypeName":"知识点","lastExamPointFlag":0,"priority":1,"queId":"0oldwJlhBHFyxipDopd","sortIndex":637},{"coreFlag":0,"examPointFlag":1,"knowId":"5ec349c8518ec3c65e1e8b50","knowName":"三角形中角的计算","knowTypeId":"5d424a75a7cbaf0014c9df23","knowTypeName":"题型","lastExamPointFlag":0,"priority":2,"queId":"0oldwJlhBHFyxipDopd","sortIndex":649},{"coreFlag":0,"examPointFlag":0,"knowId":"5ec34a99518ec3c65e1e8b55","knowName":"全等三角形的性质及推广","knowTypeId":"5d424a75a7cbaf0014c9df22","knowTypeName":"知识点","lastExamPointFlag":0,"priority":1,"queId":"0oldwJlhBHFyxipDopd","sortIndex":654},{"coreFlag":0,"examPointFlag":0,"knowId":"5ec34ab1518ec3c65e1e8b57","knowName":"全等三角形的判定定理SAS","knowTypeId":"5d424a75a7cbaf0014c9df22","knowTypeName":"知识点","lastExamPointFlag":0,"priority":1,"queId":"0oldwJlhBHFyxipDopd","sortIndex":656},{"coreFlag":0,"examPointFlag":0,"knowId":"5ec34ba2518ec3c65e1e8b5a","knowName":"截长补短法构造全等三角形","knowTypeId":"5d424a75a7cbaf0014c9df22","knowTypeName":"知识点","lastExamPointFlag":0,"priority":1,"queId":"0oldwJlhBHFyxipDopd","sortIndex":660},{"coreFlag":0,"examPointFlag":1,"knowId":"5ec34c09518ec3c65e1e8b60","knowName":"利用全等三角形的性质证明角、线段相等","knowTypeId":"5d424a75a7cbaf0014c9df23","knowTypeName":"题型","lastExamPointFlag":0,"priority":2,"